        "trash.fast_food_abo.impact": ["de": "Diese Gewohnheit (Fast Food) kostet dich langfristig Energie, Zeit und Geld. Sie hindert dich daran, dein volles Potenzial auszuschöpfen.", "en": "This habit (Fast Food) costs you energy, time, and money in the long run. It prevents you from reaching your full potential.", "es": "This habit (Fast Food) costs you energy, time, and money in the long run. It prevents you from reaching your full potential.", "fr": "This habit (Fast Food) costs you energy, time, and money in the long run. It prevents you from reaching your full potential.", "it": "This habit (Fast Food) costs you energy, time, and money in the long run. It prevents you from reaching your full potential.", "pt": "This habit (Fast Food) costs you energy, time, and money in the long run. It prevents you from reaching your full potential.", "ja": "This habit (Fast Food) costs you energy, time, and money in the long run. It prevents you from reaching your full potential.", "ko": "This habit (Fast Food) costs you energy, time, and money in the long run. It prevents you from reaching your full potential.", "pl": "This habit (Fast Food) costs you energy, time, and money in the long run. It prevents you from reaching your full potential.", "nl": "This habit (Fast Food) costs you energy, time, and money in the long run. It prevents you from reaching your full potential.", "tr": "This habit (Fast Food) costs you energy, time, and money in the long run. It prevents you from reaching your full potential."],
        "trash.fast_food_abo.tips": ["de": "**Schlechte Gewohnheit loswerden (Fast Food)**\n1. Unsichtbar machen: Entferne die Auslöser aus deinem Sichtfeld.\n2. Unattraktiv machen: Mache dir die negativen Folgen bewusst.\n3. Schwierig machen: Baue Hürden ein (z.B. Apps löschen, Stecker ziehen).\n4. Unbefriedigend machen: Verbinde die Ausführung mit einer Strafe.\n\n**Gute Gewohnheit etablieren (Gesund kochen)**\n1. Offensichtlich machen: Platziere den Auslöser gut sichtbar.\n2. Attraktiv machen: Verbinde es mit etwas, das du magst.\n3. Einfach machen: Reduziere die Hürden auf ein Minimum (z.B. nur 2 Minuten).\n4. Befriedigend machen: Belohne dich direkt im Anschluss.", "en": "**Break bad habit (Fast Food)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Gesund kochen)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately.", "es": "**Break bad habit (Fast Food)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Gesund kochen)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately.", "fr": "**Break bad habit (Fast Food)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Gesund kochen)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately.", "it": "**Break bad habit (Fast Food)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Gesund kochen)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately.", "pt": "**Break bad habit (Fast Food)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Gesund kochen)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately.", "ja": "**Break bad habit (Fast Food)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Gesund kochen)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately.", "ko": "**Break bad habit (Fast Food)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environme