        "plant.brennnessel.symbolism": ["de": "Schmerzt kurz, macht unkaputtbar – Kaltdusche + Gym Kombo", "en": "Stings briefly, makes unbreakable – Cold shower + gym combo", "es": "Duele un momento, te vuelve irrompible – Ducha fría + gym", "fr": "Pique brièvement, rend indestructible – Douche froide + salle de sport", "it": "Stings briefly, makes unbreakable – Cold shower + gym combo", "pt": "Arde brevemente, torna-te inquebrável – Duche frio + ginásio", "ja": "短時間刺すだけで壊れなくなる – 冷水シャワーとジムの組み合わせ", "ko": "잠깐 찌르면 깨지지 않게 됩니다 – 냉수 샤워 + 체육관 콤보", "pl": "Kłuje krótko, czyni niezniszczalnym – połączenie zimnego prysznica i siłowni", "nl": "Prikt kort, maakt onbreekbaar – Koude douche + gym combo", "tr": "Kısa süreliğine acıtır, kırılmaz hale getirir – Soğuk duş + spor salonu kombinasyonu"],
